        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Jakobo wakanyampuka kuzwa ku-Beereseba, nkabela bana ba-Israyeli bakanyampula Jakobo wisaabo abacece babo abanakazi babo munola Farao nzyaakatumide kukubabweza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
